    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OPUS SCRIBA</strong> sends you on a hero\u2019s journey through a magical world filled with unknown dangers, countless riches and an opportunity to become legend. Make choices to decide your fate or roll the dice and leave it to luck. Share your story with your friends and together you may just survive journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771880/extras/60147dedcbcbae11a22afa61e11b6312.avif?t=1748454902\" width=616 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your own path</strong> \u2013 but choose wisely, every action has a variety of possible outcomes. The story has a <strong>branching narrative</strong> so each play-through will be different but your choices will greatly influence your journey and the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices will have to be made in life threatening moments, <strong>choose wisely</strong> and overcome the odds or choose poorly and face the consequences. But whatever you do - make a choice - <strong>hesitation may be fatal</strong> as the imposing threat edges closer towards you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every choice counts</strong> as you explore the realm from the barren frosts to the humid swamplands. Delve into dungeons and uncover it's secrets. <strong>Customize your character</strong> to suit your playing style and forge alliances to assist on your expedition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771880/extras/d49e61c3e38b5ae791076bd51c3cf3c5.avif?t=1748454902\" width=616 height=141 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the burden is to hard to bare <strong>put your faith in the gods</strong> and roll the dice to determine your future. The outcome will influence your choices, your abilities and your limitations. Try as we might to forge our own destiny, the fates will always intervene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771880/extras/9d0548254a206dac4208efdf00a469e7.avif?t=1748454902\" width=616 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share your story \u2013 </strong>no doubt bards will sing of your triumphs for years to come \u2013 but why wait. An invisible scribe follows you on your quest, chronicling your decisions be they good or bad, for you to <strong>share with whomever care to listen</strong>. Or for others to learn from your mistakes.\u00a0</p>",
